<h2 class="section">11.6 Debugging and Bug Fixing</h2>

<p>During the testing phase, several bugs and issues were identified and resolved:</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Bug ID</th><th>Description</th><th>Root Cause</th><th>Fix Applied</th></tr>
  <tr><td>BUG-01</td><td>Double booking allowed for same room and dates</td><td>Simple equality check on dates instead of date-range overlap logic</td><td>Implemented proper overlap detection: <code>CHECKIN__lte=checkout, CHECKOUT__gte=checkin</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>BUG-02</td><td>Room type image not displaying after edit</td><td>Image field not included in the edit form's enctype</td><td>Added <code>enctype="multipart/form-data"</code> to the edit form</td></tr>
  <tr><td>BUG-03</td><td>Chatbot returned empty response for some queries</td><td>Keyword matching was case-sensitive</td><td>Converted user message to lowercase before comparison</td></tr>
  <tr><td>BUG-04</td><td>ForeignKey assignment error when adding room</td><td>Passing string ID instead of model object</td><td>Used <code>roomtypedb.objects.get(id=type_id)</code> to get the object before assignment</td></tr>
  <tr><td>BUG-05</td><td>OTP comparison failed even with correct OTP</td><td>Whitespace in pasted OTP string</td><td>Added <code>.strip()</code> to both user input and session value before comparison</td></tr>
  <tr><td>BUG-06</td><td>Payment amount incorrect in Razorpay</td><td>Amount not multiplied by 100 (Razorpay uses paise)</td><td>Changed to <code>amount = int(price * 100)</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>BUG-07</td><td>Staff page crash when staff has no image</td><td>Template accessing <code>.url</code> on null ImageField</td><td>Added conditional check in chatbot: <code>if room.ROOMIMAGE else None</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>BUG-08</td><td>Search by room type returned all rooms</td><td>Filter used wrong field name</td><td>Changed to <code>ROOMTYPE__ROOMTYPE__icontains</code> for FK lookup</td></tr>
</table>

